id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-nanshi019-shu-han-younger","a-nanshi019-han-chun-younger","a-nanshi019-chun-yu-younger"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieshu-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","quote":"甝弟述字景先，小字道兒。少有至行，隨純在江陵，純遇害，述奉純喪還都，至西塞遇暴風，純喪舫流漂不知所在，述乘小船尋求，經純妻庾舫過。庾遣人謂曰：「小郎去必無及，寧可存亡俱盡邪。」述號泣答曰：「若安全至岸，尙須營理；如其已致意外，述亦無心獨存。」因冒浪而進，見純喪幾沒，述號叫呼天，幸而獲免。咸以爲精誠所致，武帝聞而嘉之。及臨豫州，諷中正以爲迎主簿，甚被器遇。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000","source_term":"甝弟述","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-shu-han-younger"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002","quote":"純弟甝字景甝，位司徒右長史。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0000","source_term":"純弟甝","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-han-chun-younger"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001","quote":"純字景懋，景仁弟也。劉毅鎮江陵，以爲衛軍長史、南平相。及王鎮惡襲毅，毅時病，佐史聞兵至，馳還入府，左右引車欲還外廨，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲安之。」及入，毅兵敗眾散，純爲人所殺。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005","source_term":"景仁弟也","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-chun-yu-younger"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"謝裕字景仁，朗弟允之子、而晦從父也。名與宋武帝諱同，故以字行。允字令度，位宣城內史。景仁幼爲從祖安所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯景仁不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子雲何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十而方佐著作郎。」玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","source_term":"允之子","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"具名兄弟句逐步連到其中一人的明父；父系為可撤回編輯組裝。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieshu-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu","raw_mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000","c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0003","c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0018"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0003","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0003"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0018","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0018"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":2,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002","c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0004"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_me