m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005","source_term":"景仁弟也","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-chun-yu-younger"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"謝裕字景仁，朗弟允之子、而晦從父也。名與宋武帝諱同，故以字行。允字令度，位宣城內史。景仁幼爲從祖安所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯景仁不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子雲何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十而方佐著作郎。」玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","source_term":"允之子","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"具名兄弟句逐步連到其中一人的明父；父系為可撤回編輯組裝。","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB"}],"mentions":[{"start":2,"end":3,"surface":"甝","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝甝。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan"},{"start":4,"end":6,"surface":"景甝","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0004","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝甝。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan"},{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"甝","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝甝。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu"},{"start":3,"end":4,"surface":"甝","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002:m0003","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝甝。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p002","chapter_id":"c-